{"product_id":"corda-doro-vol-15-15-la-corda-doro","title":"Corda d'Oro, Vol. 15 (15) (La Corda d'Oro)","description":"\u003cp\u003eEvery few years, the Seisou Academy music competition offers students fame, fortune...and love?Every few years, the prestigious Seisou Academy holds a prominent musical competition, and only the very best students at the Academy are allowed to participate. Though all are eligible to apply, only students from the music department actually make it to the competition...until now.As Len prepares to leave Japan to study abroad, Kahoko struggles with the changes in her own life. Can she find a way to say farewell to Len before it’s too late? Can she ace the upcoming music contest without Len’s tutoring—or the help of her magic violin? And what will she do when more than one guy decides it’s time to make a move?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 184\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Yuki Kure\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421539980\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45414011043993,"sku":"Manga-A-49781421539980","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683035833da6e-Corda-d-Oro-Vol-15-15-La-Corda-d-Oro-_1.jpg?v=1748276939","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/corda-doro-vol-15-15-la-corda-doro","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}